1
00:00:00,140 --> 00:00:03,850
Imagine your bank pinned your
statement to a public board.

2
00:00:04,190 --> 00:00:07,640
Your pharmacy. Your rent. Your salary.

3
00:00:07,790 --> 00:00:11,060
Anyone walking past can read it. Forever.

4
00:00:11,560 --> 00:00:12,930
That's Bitcoin.

5
00:00:13,080 --> 00:00:15,480
Every payment sits on a public ledger,

6
00:00:15,520 --> 00:00:19,350
and one payment tied to your
name can unravel the rest.

7
00:00:19,830 --> 00:00:24,179
Everybody in the world can see
who sent what to whom and when.

8
00:00:24,909 --> 00:00:30,839
Monero fixed that for money: hidden
sender, hidden amount, one-time addresses.

9
00:00:31,369 --> 00:00:35,919
Tari takes the next step: apps
that run on a private network.

10
00:00:36,009 --> 00:00:37,619
It's called the Ootle.
